{"step_index":565,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-22T00:46:43Z","thinking":"Dashboard enhancement involves adding a health matrix bar chart across four layers, visualizing operational status, upgrade needs, and replacement needs. Strategic ratio tiles will also be added to show key metrics like the number of specialized databases and the percentage of trọng unit coverage.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Thêm biểu đồ phân tích sức khỏe theo tầng lớp và chỉ số chiến lược vào Dashboard Hiện Trạng","EndLine":585,"Instruction":"Enrich Dashboard view with layer health matrix chart, strategic ratios, and upgraded analytics","ReplacementContent":"          {/* Status highlight summary */}\n          <Row gutter={[16, 16]}>\n            <Col xs={24} md={8}>\n              <Card className=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-green-50 to-emerald-50 border-green-200 shadow-xs\" size=\"small\">\n                <div className=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                  <CheckCircleOutlined className=\"text-3xl text-green-600\" />\n                  <div>\n                    <div className=\"text-xs text-green-700 font-semibold uppercase\">Đang vận hành ổn định</div>\n                    <div className=\"text-2xl font-bold text-green-800\">{dangVanHanhCount} <span className=\"text-xs font-normal text-green-600\">({Math.round((dangVanHanhCount / totalCount) * 100)}%)</span></div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </Card>\n            </Col>\n            <Col xs={24} md={8}>\n              <Card className=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 to-yellow-50 border-amber-200 shadow-xs\" size=\"small\">\n                <div className=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                  <WarningOutlined className=\"text-3xl text-amber-500\" />\n                  <div>\n                    <div className=\"text-xs text-amber-700 font-semibold uppercase\">Cần n